I skype in Lojban with anyone who asks. Since finding topics to discuss can
get difficult at some point, I also host a minecraft server where the rule
is to speak only Lojban. It's good practice for more spatial things, which
are otherwise seldom talked about on IRC.

If you'd like to skype, just send me an e-mail with your skype name, and if
you're interested in playing lojban minecraft as well, let me know and I
can tell you the server details.

.i mi'e la tsani mu'o


